- The Company completed its H-share listing in Hong Kong last year. The IPO lock-up period will end on **17 December**. During this period, we recommend the Company adopt appropriate capital-markets initiatives (through selected channels and approaches) to support a fair valuation and facilitate a rational convergence of share price to intrinsic value.  
